/* =============================================================
   translations.js  –  English → Tagalog (Filipino) dictionary
   Load this BEFORE i18n.js on every page.

   HOW TO ADD / FIX A TRANSLATION
   - Add a line to  exact:  "English text": "Tagalog text"
     (matching ignores extra spaces, line breaks and letter case)
   - For sentences that contain numbers or changing words,
     add a rule to  patterns:  [ /regex/, "template with $1" ]
   - Type  I18N.missing()  in the browser console (F12) while the
     page is in Tagalog to list every English text not yet covered.
   ============================================================= */
